**(a) Everything here is finite.** $X \times Y$ is finite ([[thm-product-rule]],
clause 1), so $R$ is finite as a subset of it, and $R_x \subseteq Y$ and
$R^{y} \subseteq X$ are finite as subsets of finite sets
